# No dark UI

k-thread stays on the **light kube** shell. Do **not** ship dark backgrounds, black HUD canvases, or neon-on-black graph themes.

- Structure, Links, landing, rails, dialogs: light washes (`--kube-*` / light `--hud-*` aliases)
- Accent red is fine as a **signal** on light surfaces
- **Structure:** white step widgets, soft dotted field, charcoal arrows
- **Links:** GTD pastel pills, thin charcoal arrows, white field — not cyberpunk black
- Never mix folder edges and wikilink edges on one canvas
